=== ffm domain add
Usage:
  ffm domain add <domain> [bench] [flags]

Examples:
  ffm domain add erp.internal
  ffm domain add shop.test mybench
  ffm domain add erp.example.org prodbench --tls

Flags:
      --tls   Serve the aliases over HTTPS with Let's Encrypt instead of plain HTTP. Production benches with SSL only, and every alias must be publicly resolvable — Traefik puts them in one certificate request, so a name it cannot reach fails the whole order.

Global Flags:
      --non-interactive   Never open interactive prompts; fail with a message naming the missing flag instead. Implied when $CI or $FFM_NON_INTERACTIVE is set, or when there is no controlling terminal (set $FFM_INTERACTIVE=1 to force prompting back on)
